{"title":"전당포 시노부의 보석상자","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=cIfZ7S/hAd4iylgvO/irOtPrZdb4q3jWpuEd0fOk&filename=th3","synopsis":"그는 우리 가게의 저당품입니다.\n\n\n고등학교 2학년 시노부의 집은 도쿄 번화가의 전당포 쿠라타야.\n시노부는 어린 나이에도 가게에 나가 천부적인 재능(?)으로 보석 감정을 하고 있다.\n그런데 남친도 없는 그녀에게는 할아버지가 멋대로 정한 약혼자가 있었으니…\n그는 바로 명문가의 후계자이지만, 사연이 있어 어렸을 때 쿠라타야에 맡겨진 키타가미 아키사다!\n고급 주얼리샵에서 외판원으로 일하는 그에게는 어떤 비밀이 있는데…?\n\nNanatsuya Shinobu No Hosekibako\nⓒ Tomoko Ninomiya 2014. All rights reserved.\nFirst published in Japan in 2014 by Kodansha Ltd.,Tokyo\nElectronic Publishing rights for this Korean edition arranged through Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":167,"change":{"type":"up","amount":95}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":169,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":164,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":154,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":164,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":171,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":169,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":171,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":240,"change":{"type":"down","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":188,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":170,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":182,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":165,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":155,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":267,"change":{"type":"down","amount":112}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":171